<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n85571" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολύ-χρῡσος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>rich in gold,</i> of
			persons, cities, etc., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Μυκήνη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					11.46
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>El.</u>
				9
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ὄλυμπος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					B.
					10.4
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δῶμα,</span> of Delphi, <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>P.</u>
				4.53
			</span></i>; of Dolon, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				10.315
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Γύγης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Archil.
					25.1
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Pers.</u>
				3
			</span></i> (anap.), etc.: rarely in Prose, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. ἀνήρ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Cyr.</u>
					3.2.25
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				2.30
			</span></i>, al., <i><span class="en">
				Jul.
				<u>Or.</u>
				2.93d
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φρούριον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Pomp.</u>
					36
				</span></i>
			 (
				Sup.
			); of Croesus, <i><span class="en">
				Pittac.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				D.L.
				1.81
			</span></i> (
				Sup.
			). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> as
			epith. of Aphrodite, 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χρύσεος</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Hes.
				<u>Op.</u>
				521
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Fr.</u>
				143.3
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>h.Ven.</u>
				1
			</span></i>.</div>
